  "intro": [
    "Kajaawa is an online local travel website dealing in taxi services in Shillong, Cherrapunjee, Dawki in Meghalaya and Guwahati, Kaziranga and Assam. We also provide bike rental services in Shillong, Meghalaya.",
    "We are the trusted and reliable taxi service provider in Meghalaya and Assam. We have local licensed drivers having knoweldge of Meghalaya and Assam routes. Since 2018 we have been providing taxi service in Meghalaya and Assam.",
    "Our airport transfers are done by local drivers and we have the best airport taxi fare like for Shillong Airport Taxi and Guwahati Airport Taxi. Kajaawa also offers thoughtfully curated tour packages, making it easier to explore destinations with well-planned itineraries and worth-taking experiences.",
    "We also provide the best hotels in Shillong. Apart from hotels we also provide experiential stays like resorts, homestays, tent stays. For groups and budget travellers, we also provide cheaper hotels and stays in Shillong, Cherrapunjee and other places of Meghalaya.",
    "We provide car hire and bike rentals for all occasions. There are some solo travellers who want to travel alone for which we provide taxi on sharing basis.",
    "We have in our fleet clean and maintained cabs. We have different range of economic cabs available at your doorstep."
  ],
